; RUN: dgtl-opt --pass=gvn --filecheck %s
; FileCheck test for Global Value Numbering (GVN) pass
;
; This test verifies that GVN correctly identifies and eliminates
; redundant computations by matching patterns in the optimized IR output.

; CHECK: DGTL IR Text Format
; CHECK-NEXT: Stream size:
; CHECK-NOT: redundant_value
; CHECK: opcode=
; CHECK: result=
